# seis-waves.js

File: src/data/presets/seis-waves.js (generated: never edited by hand)

From the dataset: seis-waves — Tohoku 2011 recorded on three components at fourteen GSN stations:
  the kinds of waves told apart by their motion, and the direction the P wave came from
  (data/seis/waves/, every input with its own .explain)
